WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
The United Kingdom is an island nation in northwestern Europe, comprising England, Scotland, Wales, and Northern Ireland.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Ben Nevis in the Scottish Highlands rises to 1,345 meters as the highest summit in the British Isles.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
In Wiltshire, the prehistoric Stonehenge stone circle dates back more than 4,500 years.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Traditional Scottish attire features wool Tartan Kilts paired with the Great Highland Bagpipe.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Classic British dining highlights golden Fish and Chips served with tartar sauce and afternoon tea.

